.venv

# Logs
logs/
alfred/logs/

# PDM
.pdm-python
build/

# Data
data/
# Playwright JSON report, an intermediate for the recipe video collector, and
# the collector's list for the GIF converter.
website/recipe-report.json
website/recipe-videos.json

# Recipe recordings and GIFs. `./al recipes` writes both here, for watching:
# the docs served locally play each recording in the cookbook
# (scripts/docs_recordings.py). Neither is committed, because a GIF does not
# compress against its last version and every refresh would add megabytes to
# history. The committed cookbook links none of them.
docs/recipes/

# The docs' screenshots, which `./al recipes` takes (screens.spec.js), are
# committed despite *.png above.
!docs/assets/screens/*.png

# Test-render output moved aside during review prep; regenerable, never shipped.
videos-test-output/

# This checkout's own development signing key, created by ./al (see dev.yml).
.secret_key.local

# `./al family`'s logs and the record of the joe it started (scripts/family.py).
.family/
